{"__q": {"t": "Настоящие времена — Сборник 2", "q": [{"s": "Choose: «She ___ TV at the moment.»", "o": ["has watched", "is watching", "watched", "watches"], "e": "«At the moment» — указатель Continuous."}, {"s": "Complete: «We ___ each other for ten years.»", "o": ["are knowing", "have known", "know", "knew"], "e": "«For» + глагол состояния → Present Perfect."}, {"s": "Which is correct?", "o": ["Do she like it?", "Does she like it?", "Is she like it?", "Does she likes it?"], "e": "После «does» глагол остаётся в начальной форме."}, {"s": "Complete: «I ___ just ___ lunch.»", "o": ["did / have", "am / having", "has / had", "have / had"], "e": "«Just» употребляется с Present Perfect."}, {"s": "Choose: «The train ___ at 6 p.m. tomorrow.»", "o": ["left", "will leave", "leaves", "is leaving"], "e": "События по расписанию выражаются в Present Simple."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ for three hours and he's tired.»", "o": ["has been working", "worked", "is working", "works"], "e": "Действие длится, и его результат виден."}, {"s": "Which sentence uses Present Perfect correctly?", "o": ["I have seen him before.", "I have saw him.", "I has seen him.", "I have seen him yesterday."], "e": "С указателем конкретного прошедшего времени Present Perfect не употребляется."}, {"s": "Complete: «Listen! Someone ___ the door.»", "o": ["has knocked", "knocked", "is knocking", "knocks"], "e": "Действие, происходящее в настоящий момент."}, {"s": "Choose: «She usually ___ coffee in the morning.»", "o": ["drink", "drinks", "drank", "is drinking"], "e": "«Usually» — указатель Present Simple."}, {"s": "Complete: «This is the best film I ___ ever ___ .»", "o": ["did / see", "am / seeing", "has / seen", "have / seen"], "e": "Превосходная степень + ever → Present Perfect."}]}, "Present Tenses — 2-ci toplu": "Настоящие времена — Сборник 2"}